begincodeV2
name:世界坐标转局部方位角
params:Vector3 世界坐标
return:Vector3 方位角
lines:
Vector3 局部坐标=act 1.this.wordToLocalPos(var 世界坐标)
Float x=varf Vector3.局部坐标.x()
Float y=varf Vector3.局部坐标.y()
Float z=varf Vector3.局部坐标.z()
Float temp0=fun float.pow(var x:Float 2)
Float temp1=fun float.pow(var z:Float 2)
Float temp2=fun float.add(var temp0:var temp1)
Float temp2=fun float.pow(var temp2:Float 0.5)
Float tany=fun float.division(var y:var temp2)
Float y角度=fun float.triangle.atan(var tany)
Vector3 水平分量=fun creatVariable.Vector3(var x:Float 0:var z)
Float x角度=fun vector3.signedAngle(var 水平分量:Vector3 1,0,0:Vector3 0,1,0)
Vector3 方位角=fun creatVariable.Vector3(var x角度:var y角度:Float 0)
endcode